  "description": "Blackthorn 125 C Eagle 90 Transmission is a carbon fiber trail MTB that’s designed with the versatility to take on all-day singletrack sessions or all-week bikepacking adventures. Its frame features geometry balanced for climbing and descending performance and ample cargo mounts (including room for two bottles on all sizes) for easier packing.\n\nOur Split Pivot suspension design maximizes both pedaling and braking performance so you get reliable traction both up and down the mountain. A RockShox Deluxe Select+ shock delivers 125mm rear wheel travel, and the RockShox Pike Select fork gives you 140mm of front travel to play with.\n\nThe SRAM Eagle 90 Transmission components are as good a mechanical drivetrain as anything else out there, with all the gear range you need for arduous climbs or pedaling to the next trailhead in a hurry.",
